            <title><![CDATA[[updated] Secrets Manager (secrets-manager) has changed the description of the plan named trial]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[*before*: You can have one Trial instance provisioned in your account at any time. After your trial expires, functionality is removed., *after*: You may provision one Secrets Manager Standard instance per account under the Trial plan. When the trial period ends, the instance and all associated data are deleted. A Trial plan is not available for Secrets Manager Vault Dedicated.]]></description>
